<!-- F18: calculator glyph for the app-bar Tools entry. The filled `Calculate`
     icon was verified ABSENT from material-icons-core 1.7.8 (48 filled icons
     only; Build the wrench was the previous — misleading — glyph), and the
     material-icons-extended dependency is barred by the 4 MiB size gate. This
     hand-drawn stroke vector matches the tool-card icon family exactly:
     24dp viewport, strokeWidth 1.8, round cap/join, #FFFFFFFF stroke (tinted
     by the composing Icon). -->
